# --- deliberately not published -------------------------------------------
#
# research/ holds working material: extracted text and LaTeX source from
# third-party publications (Boaron, GYS, LCWX, Ma), locally written verification
# scripts, and superseded planning documents. None of it is needed to use or
# verify the code -- the citations in WHITEPAPER.md and the output of
# `quantumnet validate` point at the published originals -- and redistributing
# the third-party sources would be a copyright problem. Kept on disk only.
research/

# A single local tool identifier, not project content.
.freebuff/

# A decoder prototype workspace: a working subfolder by design, holding its own
# copies of source files and notes. Promote from here into src/ deliberately.
decoder_work/

# Scratch output from development scripts.
_jscheck.txt
_enc_report.txt
_plan_base.txt
_plan_tail.txt
_plan_fixed.md
_plan_repaired.md
